<title>ITALY: GAN Italia doubles H1 1996 profit.</title>
<headline>GAN Italia doubles H1 1996 profit.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gan Italia, a unit of French insurer GAN - St Centrale du Groupe des Assurances Nationales, said it posted first half 1996 pre-tax profit of 24.7 billion lire against 10.7 billion in the first six months of 1995.</p>
<p>At the same time premium income rose 6.6 percent to 268 billion lire, the group said in a statement, adding that the increase in life premium income, accounting for 30 percent of the total, was 5.3 percent.</p>
<p>Total investments in the first half rose 15 percent to 1.53 trillion lire, it added.</p>
<p>-- Milan newsroom +392 66129589</p>
</text>
